rgencies.  \n3. By winning the trick, I can lead next with a weaker card (e.g., a single low card to test reactions) or a combination from my hand.  \n4. If Right does beat ♣A with 2 or BlackJoker, that uses one of their few cards, and I still have RedJoker to retaliate.  \n\nPassing risks letting Left continue with more low singles and possibly escape with their 6 cards.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♣A"]}'}
